  "description": "Changes to the garden only of 25A Prah Road. Removal of existing boundary wall to street and south side, retention of existing wall to north side. New boundary walls to street and south with dogtooth detailing. New brick wall piers with stone coping and decorative string course. Black metal raillng on top of walls, and electric, black metal vehicular and pedestrian gates. Metal arch to pedestrian entrance. Recontouring of levels within garden to make accessible access from vehicle and street to front door. Movement of pedestrian gate position and widening of vehicular gate to allow space for wheelchair access. New permeable paving. Removal of trees/shrubs. Replanting of trees/shrubs/perennials. Installation of bike store and water butt. Installation of lighting, EV charger and irrigation.",
